================================================================================
Internal Modules (this project's own code, not third-party)
================================================================================

The artifacts under groupId com.cosmo.plugins / com.cosmo.hhim.thirdplat /
com.cosmo.hhim.micro are this project's own modules, not third-party
components. Their source code is contained in this repository
(cosmo-himm-commom / hhim-third-platform / hhim-micro-be) and is released
under the MIT License together with this project.

They are built from source by the root pom's reactor, so no prebuilt jars and
no private artifact repository are required:

    mvn clean install -DskipTests      # run from the repository root

Note: hhim-common-swagger and hhim-common-uuc were removed during the
open-source cleanup (2026-02) because their source code is not in this
repository and no module referenced them.

